            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.11

- Reverted the full-screen lyric scrolling to the smooth, reliable version. The recent offset-based experiment could look glitchy on line changes and dimmed the current line, so it's gone.
- Removed the romanization line under lyrics.
- Press the space bar in the full-screen view to play or pause, like Apple Music's Now Playing screen.
]]></description>
